{"id":"1910373218","kind":"answer","title":"在线教育或将大裁员，如何看待这次堪称行业生死转折点的史上最大裁员?","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"学校教育问题","date":"2021-05-28","updated":"2021-05-28","votes":61,"comment_count":17,"minutes":1,"chars":210,"keywords":["强制教育","自主教育","受教育自由","儿童权利"],"summary":"要是国内的在线教育能像国外的这个平台那么好，那对学习者来说一定是福音。 【介绍】Osmosis——视频网课、卡片与间隔重复的有机结合 通过堆人力肯定不是条可持续的路子，引入教育技术创新才能降低成本，让更多普通人得到更好的教育资源。我们的终极目标应当是： 教育解放宣言 另外，结合认知科学，并应用于实践，在国外已经有很长的历史了…","question_detail_html":"<p>36氪从知情人士处独家获悉，高途课堂创始人陈向东日前召开了内部会，会议结果是高途课堂将裁员30%，本周开始执行；同时信息流业务、直播业务全部关停。</p><p>与之对应的是脉脉上的爆料。一位脉脉用户日前发布了消息：「高途课堂，这么不靠谱吗？发了offer，又通知不招人了」，其评论区有数条回应表示遇到了类似问题。另一位脉脉用户透露：“高途课堂hc冻结了，应届生offer几乎算是被收回了”。</p><p>虽然事出突然，但并非无迹可寻。近几个月教育行业监管趋严，日前曾流传出「教培机构不许上市」的言论。如果传言为真，教育业务则将成为未来拖累字节跳动上市的累赘。</p><p>此外，据脉脉用户爆料：“作业帮裁员”，“网易有道要裁员了，果然k12公司都逃不过一劫”；同时36氪从一位行业人士处了解到：镇江学而思被通知暂停招聘动作，南京学而思对大四全职招聘已暂停，对外口径为“已招满”，目前只招聘暑期兼职。</p><p>“按照目前的情况，今年暑期全行业岗位裁减可能会超过10万个。”一位在线教育公司的高管告诉36氪。这个在2020年风头无二的行业，直接从爆发期进入了生死转折点。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-6b85a2dfc3cb152c64217b7dd53367ef_r.jpg\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/461837840/answer/1910373218","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"QHd7ssKE\">要是国内的在线教育能像国外的这个平台那么好，那对学习者来说一定是福音。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-4624995d4d7f7b886db792e08b7b6880_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e3b524809229f41628120f5fefde64ed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e3b524809229f41628120f5fefde64ed_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1642\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-4624995d4d7f7b886db792e08b7b6880_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e3b524809229f41628120f5fefde64ed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e3b524809229f41628120f5fefde64ed_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1642\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><a class=\"internal\" data-entity-type=\"article\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-883a2a00c76f77bf0d7bc6a59cf49f10_720w.jpg\" data-size=\"small\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/106058169\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【介绍】Osmosis——视频网课、卡片与间隔重复的有机结合</a><p data-pid=\"q2CnkIIA\">通过堆人力肯定不是条可持续的路子，引入教育技术创新才能降低成本，让更多普通人得到更好的教育资源。我们的终极目标应当是：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d2a9d4a869d22e0474c32f77ce2c77ee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-377f5b6f96c3c55f3b5aa0074dbf4124\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-377f5b6f96c3c55f3b5aa0074dbf4124_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1837\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d2a9d4a869d22e0474c32f77ce2c77ee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-377f5b6f96c3c55f3b5aa0074dbf4124\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-377f5b6f96c3c55f3b5aa0074dbf4124_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1837\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-entity-type=\"article\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-fdd80406d7ff698b4bbe3a809de3963a_r.jpg\" data-size=\"small\" data-tm-id=\"268258730\" href=\"#/post/268258730\">教育解放宣言</a><p data-pid=\"rCRr8KWy\">另外，结合认知科学，并应用于实践，在国外已经有很长的历史了，我们也要加把劲跟上：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-entity-type=\"article\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-e2f3e31b3b37b0c9b2abe6171cf5329f_720w.jpg\" data-size=\"small\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/375379522\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">0 Content 目录《间隔重复的历史》</a><p data-pid=\"aVntnRfD\">教育，决不能是资本的游戏。</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"268258730","title":"教育解放宣言","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":163,"minutes":1,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"268255239","title":"儿童应有投票权","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":33,"minutes":4,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"2070517039278600402","title":"严肃的玩耍：迷你慕尼黑，不仅仅是儿童的娱乐","author":"Horst Rumpf","votes":17,"minutes":15,"reason":"延伸深读 · Horst Rumpf"},{"id":"592277212","title":"结束学校奴役","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":985,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"455062362","title":"常见问题：禁止学校的胁迫行为","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":31,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"614870253","title":"最基本的自由是退出的自由","author":"Peter Gray","votes":645,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Peter Gray"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2767020207","title":"浙江宁波拟推出「教师退出机制」，退出渠道包括待岗、转岗、离岗退养、解聘，将带来哪些影响？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":45,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 45 赞同"},{"id":"1881914623","title":"如何看待我国 2020 年出生人口为 1200 万人，处于较低生育水平？这一数字意味着什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 16 赞同"},{"id":"2070119780477153570","title":"传销犯变身「国学大师」创办如是书院暴力管教孩子，浙江开启调查，这个书院为啥能横行多年？反映出哪些问题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":283,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 283 赞同"},{"id":"1574263254","title":"如何看待教育局做学校满意度调查，老师向家长发标准答案？暴露了哪些问题？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 6 赞同"},{"id":"2488995325","title":"如何评价指挥网友声援A-SOUL讨伐字节控评引流的粉头“Karl Marx”是名作业没写完的高一学生?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":18,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 18 赞同"}]}